---
// src/pages/fine-print/method.astro
// The methodology frame, kept to a short clinical methods note. Procedure,
// the load-as-filed principle, scope, and the audit boundary. The full
// divergence register is Footnotes; the exhaustive technical note is in the repo.

import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Method | RTFP"
  description="How the RTFP dataset is built: retrieved, loaded as filed, harmonised in form not substance, and served as a public API."
>
  <div class="method">
    <a class="back-to-fineprint" href="/fine-print">&larr; The Fine Print</a>
    <p class="eyebrow">The Fine Print</p>
    <h1>Method</h1>

    <p>
      The dataset covers 22 very large online platforms for the second half of 2025, the first cycle
      reported under Commission Implementing Regulation 2024/2835. We retrieved each provider's published
      filing from its source, loaded it into a Postgres database as filed with one figure per source cell,
      and harmonised it through numbered SQL migrations. We normalised the form of the data and recorded 
      each change and kept the original. The transforms are listed in <a href="/fine-print/footnotes">Footnotes</a>. 
      The derived comparison views over the harmonised data are served as a read-only public API, which this site reads at
      build time.
    </p>

    <p>
      The designated search engines are not yet included. Banded audience figures and restatement
      versions are reported as filed and noted in <a href="/fine-print/footnotes">Footnotes</a>.
    </p>

    <p>
      Three providers filed a document beyond the eleven harmonised files. AliExpress and TikTok
      published narrative reports on their processes and methods, and Google reported its recipient
      figures in a separate document covering all its services. None of these form part of the
      comparable dataset, and each is noted on the provider's page.
    </p>

    <p>
      The loaders and numbered migrations are in the
      <a href="https://github.com/pushkinoxt/rtfp-data" target="_blank" rel="noopener">data repository</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .method .back-to-fineprint { display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--ink-faint); text-decoration: none; }
  .method .back-to-fineprint:hover { color: var(--ink); }
  .method .eyebrow { font-family: ui-monospace, "SF Mono", Menlo, monospace; font-size: 0.72rem; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-faint); margin: 0 0 0.6rem; }
  .method h1 { font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 0 0 1rem; }
  .method p { font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--ink-dim); max-width: 70ch; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 0.9rem; }
  .method a { color: var(--ink); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 2px; }
  .method a:hover { color: var(--ink-dim); }
</style>